{"id": "sdqa0042", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2895753611, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "9d39a2003e15ffbac1b46fe5b0a53c242ef024ed6b8b1e37a92e22d426213d95", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Where are Porsches manufactured?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0042.wav", "input_sha256": "965de7c8ab095da2893c00fe417180725cb81e04ecaa016dd004360ddeeeee73", "input_samples": 83280, "input_s": 5.205, "n_real_chunks": 6, "score": 0.7974, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Porsches are mainly manufactured in Germany, especially at: Stuttgart-Zuffenhausen, Germany — 911, Taycan, and engines , Leipzig, Germany — Macan and Panamera , Bratislava, Slovakia — Cayenne body/assembly through Volkswagen Group facilities So the short answer is: primarily Germany, with some production in Slovakia.", "expert_answer": "Porsches are mainly manufactured in **Germany**, especially at:\n\n- **Stuttgart-Zuffenhausen, Germany** — 911, Taycan, and engines\n- **Leipzig, Germany** — Macan and Panamera\n- **Bratislava, Slovakia** — Cayenne body/assembly through Volkswagen Group facilities\n\nSo the short answer is: **primarily Germany, with some production in Slovakia.**", "transcript": "Where are Porsches manufactured?\n", "asr_s": 0.75, "expert_s": 2.16, "expert_input_samples": 83280, "expert_input_s": 5.205, "expert_input_sha256": "965de7c8ab095da2893c00fe417180725cb81e04ecaa016dd004360ddeeeee73", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 2.247, "relay_synth_ms": 10216, "onset_chunk": 5, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0042_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "e4b0d15583be3bdb68789a234347806d9317