{"id": "sdqa0109", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1592117040, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "9d39a2003e15ffbac1b46fe5b0a53c242ef024ed6b8b1e37a92e22d426213d95", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "What is Emmanouil Pappas known for?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0109.wav", "input_sha256": "cd86ad4118c5bc5c85121d73b0df2a3f4d73b9b9a95b6fe05126fbae83223506", "input_samples": 71959, "input_s": 4.497, "n_real_chunks": 5, "score": 0.9221, "act": 0.9992, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Emmanuel Pappas is known as a film producer, production manager, and philanthropist, especially for producing the Netflix film Skater Girl and co-founding Skatepark Films and the Skate Basti Foundation, which supports children in underserved communities through skate parks, art, play, and education. (imdb.com) If you meant Emmanouel Pappas — the historical figure — he is known as a leader in the Greek War of Independence against Ottoman rule in Macedonia.", "expert_answer": "Emmanuel Pappas is known as a **film producer, production manager, and philanthropist**, especially for producing the Netflix film **_Skater Girl_** and co-founding **Skatepark Films** and the **Skate Basti Foundation**, which supports children in underserved communities through skate parks, art, play, and education. ([imdb.com](https://www.imdb.com/name/nm1070009/bio/?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you meant **Emmanouel Pappas** — the historical figure — he is known as a **leader in the Greek War of Independence against Ottoman rule** in Macedonia.", "transcript": "What is Emmanuel Pappas known for?\n", "asr_s": 0.87, "expert_s": 4.99, "expert_input_samples": 71959, "expert_input_s": 4.497, "expert_input_sha256": "cd86ad4118c5bc5c85121d73b0df2a3f4